<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collybus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collŭbus</span></b> ), i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλυβος</span> [prob. of
		Phoenicio-Semitic origin, kindr. with the Heb. , to change],
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the exchange of
				coins of different kinds</i>, or <i>of different
				countries</i>, <i>agio.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop., <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				12, 6, 1</span></i>; Cassiod. Parm. ap. <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>the rate</i> or <i>premium of exchange</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 78, §
		181</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
